# Folder synchronization (specs/003-folder-sync). US1: pair a server folder with a reader folder, change it, remove it; saving a pair
# changes nothing on either side. Run it after 10-no-trash.walk with the same server and folders (quickstart.md, steps 1).
size 1404 1872
waitfor homeState Connected to Example Cloud
tap homeSync
waitfor syncEmpty No pairs yet
shot @OUT@/90-sync-empty.png

# a new pair: the server folder Books, a new reader folder Mirror, the default direction (download only)
tap syncAdd
waitfor pairServerFolder
shot @OUT@/91-pair-new.png
tap pairServerFolder
waitfor chooserRow
tap chooserRow 1
waitfor chooserPath Books
tap chooserChoose
waitfor pairServerFolder Books
tap pairReaderFolder
waitfor pickerPath
tap pickerNewFolder
type Mirror
shot @OUT@/92-new-folder.png
tap footerButton 1
wait 500
expect pickerRow Mirror
shot @OUT@/93-reader-folders.png
tap pickerRow 1
wait 500
tap pickerChooseFolder
waitfor pairReaderFolder Mirror
expect pairDirection Download only (selected)
shot @OUT@/94-pair-filled.png
tap pairSave
waitfor syncPairRow
expect syncPairTitle Books
expect syncPairTitle Mirror
expect syncPairState Never synced
shot @OUT@/95-sync-one-pair.png

# change it: Sync at start on; the pair says "Never synced" still and nothing was requested (the row's menu: Sync, Settings)
tap syncPairRow
wait 400
tap choiceRow 1
waitfor pairServerFolder
tap pairStartup
tap pairSave
waitfor syncPairRow
expect syncPairState Never synced

# the three directions are all offered
tap syncPairRow
wait 400
tap choiceRow 1
waitfor pairServerFolder
expect pairDirection Upload only
expect pairDirection Two-way
shot @OUT@/96-pair-directions.png

# US2: review before anything changes, then the result. Tap Sync in the pair's menu: the plan comes up and nothing is on the reader yet.
tap pairCancel
waitfor syncPairRow
tap syncPairRow
wait 400
tap choiceRow 0
waitfor planTotals download
shot @OUT@/98-plan.png
expect planNothingChanged Nothing has been changed yet
expect planTab Transfers
expect planRow
# take the first entry out of the plan; it is marked, and Approve is still there
tap planRow 0
wait 400
expect planRowCaption Taken out of the plan
shot @OUT@/99-plan-entry-removed.png
# the offline preview does not exist while online; Cancel leaves the plan and nothing changed: compare again and approve this time
tap planCancel
waitfor syncPairRow
expect syncPairState Never synced
tap syncPairRow
wait 400
tap choiceRow 0
waitfor planApprove
tap planApprove
waitfor resultCounts downloaded
shot @OUT@/100-result.png
expect resultCounts failed
expect resultTime It took
tap resultDone
waitfor syncPairRow
expect syncPairState In sync
# the last result stays on the Sync screen
tap syncPairRow
wait 400
tap choiceRow 2
waitfor resultCounts downloaded
tap resultDone
waitfor syncPairRow
# a second sync of a pair that is in sync: nothing to do
tap syncPairRow
wait 400
tap choiceRow 0
waitfor planTotals Nothing to do
shot @OUT@/101-plan-in-sync.png
tap planCancel
waitfor syncPairRow

# remove it: the files on both sides stay
tap syncPairRow
wait 400
tap choiceRow 1
waitfor pairServerFolder
tap pairRemove
waitfor dialogText stay where they are
tap footerButton 1
waitfor syncEmpty No pairs yet
shot @OUT@/97-sync-removed.png

# SC-001: adding a download-only pair takes at most 6 steps from the Sync screen. A step is a screen of its own (Add pair, the server folder, the reader folder, Save);
# choosing in a folder screen is two taps (the folder, then Choose), so the shortest way, to a reader folder that exists already, is 8 taps and never more.
taps_reset
tap syncAdd
waitfor pairServerFolder
tap pairServerFolder
waitfor chooserRow
tap chooserRow 1
waitfor chooserPath Books
tap chooserChoose
waitfor pairServerFolder Books
tap pairReaderFolder
waitfor pickerPath
tap pickerRow 1
wait 500
tap pickerChooseFolder
waitfor pairReaderFolder Mirror
tap pairSave
waitfor syncPairRow
expect syncPairState Never synced
expect_taps_max 8
tap syncPairRow
wait 400
tap choiceRow 1
waitfor pairServerFolder
tap pairRemove
waitfor dialogText stay where they are
tap footerButton 1
waitfor syncEmpty No pairs yet
tap syncBack
wait 300
